{"id":"nobara_ruins_gojo_s_shirt","lines":[{"t":0.159,"end":0.922,"chars":[0],"who":"Nobara Kugisaki","text":"Uh-","de":"Äh-","orig":"scenes/nobara_ruins_gojo_s_shirt/lines/01.mp3"},{"t":2.194,"end":4.356,"chars":[1],"who":"Yuji Itadori","text":"Oooooou...! (Taunting)","de":"Oooooou...! (Verspottung)","orig":"scenes/nobara_ruins_gojo_s_shirt/lines/02.mp3"},{"t":3.975,"end":5.819,"chars":[0],"who":"Nobara Kugisaki","text":"Oh no~! (Distressed)","de":"Oh nein~! (Verzweifelt)","orig":"scenes/nobara_ruins_gojo_s_shirt/lines/03.mp3"},{"t":6.226,"end":8.999,"chars":[1],"who":"Yuji Itadori","text":"You've really gone and done it now, Kugisaki! (Worried)","de":"Du hast es jetzt wirklich geschafft, Kugisaki! (besorgt)","orig":"scenes/nobara_ruins_gojo_s_shirt/lines/04.mp3"},{"t":8.999,"end":11.511,"chars":[1],"who":"Yuji Itadori","text":"I'm pretty sure this shirt belongs to Gojo.","de":"Ich bin mir ziemlich sicher, dass dieses Shirt Gojo gehört.","orig":"scenes/nobara_ruins_gojo_s_shirt/lines/05.mp3"},{"t":11.48,"end":13.833,"chars":[0],"who":"Nobara Kugisaki","text":"(Tense sigh)","de":"(Angespannter Seufzer)","orig":"scenes/nobara_ruins_gojo_s_shirt/lines/06.mp3"},{"t":17.638,"end":19.811,"chars":[0],"who":"Nobara Kugisaki","text":"Okay... so between Ijichi,","de":"Okay... also zwischen Ijichi,","orig":"scenes/nobara_ruins_gojo_s_shirt/lines/07.mp3"},{"t":19.779,"end":22.291,"chars":[0],"who":"Nobara Kugisaki","text":"Who left us in charge of this freshly cleaned shirt...","de":"Wer hat uns die Verantwortung für dieses frisch gereinigte Hemd überlassen ...","orig":"scenes/nobara_ruins_gojo_s_shirt/lines/08.mp3"},{"t":23.182,"end":25.122,"chars":[0],"who":"Nobara Kugisaki","text":"And me, who spilled coffee on it...","de":"Und ich, der Kaffee darauf verschüttet hat ...","orig":"scenes/nobara_ruins_gojo_s_shirt/lines/09.mp3"},{"t":25.352,"end":26.518,"chars":[0],"who":"Nobara Kugisaki","text":"Whos' more-at fault? (Persuasive)","de":"Wer ist mehr schuld? (Überzeugend)","orig":"scenes/nobara_ruins_gojo_s_shirt/lines/10.mp3"},{"t":26.518,"end":27.323,"chars":[2],"who":"Megumi Fushiguro","text":"You. (Curt)","de":"Du. (Curt)","orig":"scenes/nobara_ruins_gojo_s_shirt/lines/11.mp3"},{"t":26.518,"end":27.323,"chars":[1],"who":"Yuji Itadori","text":"You. (Curt)","de":"Du. (Curt)","orig":"scenes/nobara_ruins_gojo_s_shirt/lines/12.mp3"},{"t":29.21,"end":29.867,"chars":[1],"who":"Yuji Itadori","text":"Don't wipe! (Urgent)","de":"Nicht abwischen! (Dringend)","orig":"scenes/nobara_ruins_gojo_s_shirt/lines/13.mp3"},{"t":29.867,"end":31.308,"chars":[1],"who":"Yuji Itadori","text":"Pat-it down! Pat-it down! (Hurried)","de":"Pat-it down! Pat-it down! (beeilt)","orig":"scenes/nobara_ruins_gojo_s_shirt/lines/14.mp3"},{"t":30.969,"end":32.241,"chars":[0],"who":"Nobara Kugisaki","text":"I'm WORKING on it! (Guilty)","de":"Ich arbeite daran! (Schuldig)","orig":"scenes/nobara_ruins_gojo_s_shirt/lines/15.mp3"},{"t":32.941,"end":37.477,"chars":[1],"who":"Yuji Itadori","text":"Ummmm... *Into a croaky sigh)","de":"Ähmmm... *in einen krächzenden Seufzer)","orig":"scenes/nobara_ruins_gojo_s_shirt/lines/16.mp3"},{"t":40.508,"end":43.412,"chars":[0],"who":"Nobara Kugisaki","text":"I'm kinda thinking it looks like a Marimekko-now... (Coping)","de":"Ich denke irgendwie, dass es jetzt wie ein Marimekko aussieht ... (Bewältigung)","orig":"scenes/nobara_ruins_gojo_s_shirt/lines/17.mp3"},{"t":43.37,"end":44.854,"chars":[2],"who":"Megumi Fushiguro","text":"Please don't insult the brand. (Intolerant)","de":"Bitte beleidigen Sie die Marke nicht. (Intolerant)","orig":"scenes/nobara_ruins_gojo_s_shirt/lines/18.mp3"},{"t":45.193,"end":47.588,"chars":[0],"who":"Nobara Kugisaki","text":"Aha- I'm sure it's a cheap-shirt anyway...! (Rationalizing)","de":"Aha- ich bin mir sicher, dass es sowieso ein Billig-Shirt ist...! (Rationalisierung)","orig":"scenes/nobara_ruins_gojo_s_shirt/lines/19.mp3"},{"t":47.673,"end":49.899,"chars":[0],"who":"Nobara Kugisaki","text":"Fushiguro, look-up the shirt-online, would-ya?","de":"Fushiguro, schau doch mal online nach dem T-Shirt, ja?","orig":"scenes/nobara_ruins_gojo_s_shirt/lines/20.mp3"},{"t":50.195,"end":51.149,"chars":[2],"who":"Megumi Fushiguro","text":"(Annoyed sigh)","de":"(Genervter Seufzer)","orig":"scenes/nobara_ruins_gojo_s_shirt/lines/21.mp3"},{"t":54.668,"end":55.579,"chars":[1],"who":"Yuji Itadori","text":"Hmm...? (Curious)","de":"Hm...? (Neugierig)","orig":"scenes/nobara_ruins_gojo_s_shirt/lines/22.mp3"},{"t":54.668,"end":55.643,"chars":[0],"who":"Nobara Kugisaki","text":"Hmm...? (Curious)","de":"Hm...? (Neugierig)","orig":"scenes/nobara_ruins_gojo_s_shirt/lines/23.mp3"},{"t":57.847,"end":59.055,"chars":[0],"who":"Nobara Kugisaki","text":"(Shocked mumbling)","de":"(schockiertes Murmeln)","orig":"scenes/nobara_ruins_gojo_s_shirt/lines/24.mp3"},{"t":57.847,"end":59.076,"chars":[1],"who":"Yuji Itadori","text":"(Shocked mumbling)","de":"(schockiertes Murmeln)","orig":"scenes/nobara_ruins_gojo_s_shirt/lines/25.mp3"},{"t":59.649,"end":60.412,"chars":[1],"who":"Yuji Itadori","text":"Ah- (Concerned)","de":"Ah- (besorgt)","orig":"scenes/nobara_ruins_gojo_s_shirt/lines/26.mp3"},{"t":60.794,"end":61.875,"chars":[1],"who":"Yuji Itadori","text":"After tax? (Disbelief)","de":"Nach Steuern? (Unglaube)","orig":"scenes/nobara_ruins_gojo_s_shirt/lines/27.mp3"},{"t":61.875,"end":62.85,"chars":[2],"who":"Megumi Fushiguro","text":"Before tax. (Stern)","de":"Vor Steuern. (Stern)","orig":"scenes/nobara_ruins_gojo_s_shirt/lines/28.mp3"},{"t":63.337,"end":64.736,"chars":[2],"who":"Megumi Fushiguro","text":"Is that even important? (Miffed)","de":"Ist das überhaupt wichtig? (Verärgert)","orig":"scenes/nobara_ruins_gojo_s_shirt/lines/29.mp3"},{"t":65.054,"end":65.902,"chars":[0],"who":"Nobara Kugisaki","text":"(Yielding sigh)","de":"(Nachgebender Seufzer)","orig":"scenes/nobara_ruins_gojo_s_shirt/lines/30.mp3"},{"t":66.22,"end":69.378,"chars":[0],"who":"Nobara Kugisaki","text":"We have no choice- I can put up 90,000. (Giving in)","de":"Wir haben keine Wahl – ich kann 90.000 aufbringen. (Nachgeben)","orig":"scenes/nobara_ruins_gojo_s_shirt/lines/31.mp3"},{"t":69.781,"end":71.413,"chars":[0],"who":"Nobara Kugisaki","text":"You can each put-in-80.","de":"Sie können jeweils 80 einsetzen.","orig":"scenes/nobara_ruins_gojo_s_shirt/lines/32.mp3"},{"t":71.392,"end":72.049,"chars":[1],"who":"Yuji Itadori","text":"Gah!?","de":"Gah!?","orig":"scenes/nobara_ruins_gojo_s_shirt/lines/33.mp3"},{"t":72.155,"end":73.469,"chars":[3],"who":"Satoru Gojo","text":"Goooood morning!","de":"Guten Morgen!","orig":"scenes/nobara_ruins_gojo_s_shirt/lines/34.mp3"},{"t":73.47,"end":75.759,"chars":[3],"who":"Satoru Gojo","text":"Ijichi said you guys had my shirt-cleaned and-","de":"Ijichi sagte, ihr habt mein Hemd gereinigt und-","orig":"scenes/nobara_ruins_gojo_s_shirt/lines/35.mp3"},{"t":76.988,"end":78.345,"chars":[0],"who":"Nobara Kugisaki","text":"(Restrained giggles) (Lower your mic volume)","de":"(Verhaltenes Kichern) (Lautstärke Ihres Mikrofons verringern)","orig":"scenes/nobara_ruins_gojo_s_shirt/lines/36.mp3"},{"t":76.988,"end":78.366,"chars":[1],"who":"Yuji Itadori","text":"(Restrained giggles) (Lower your mic volume)","de":"(Verhaltenes Kichern) (Lautstärke Ihres Mikrofons verringern)","orig":"scenes/nobara_ruins_gojo_s_shirt/lines/37.mp3"},{"t":77.391,"end":79.49,"chars":[3],"who":"Satoru Gojo","text":"Megumi... what's in there? (Suspicious)","de":"Megumi... was ist da drin? (Verdächtig)","orig":"scenes/nobara_ruins_gojo_s_shirt/lines/38.mp3"},{"t":78.387,"end":80.994,"chars":[0],"who":"Nobara Kugisaki","text":"(Restrained laughter) (Lower your mic volume)","de":"(Verhaltenes Lachen) (Lautstärke Ihres Mikrofons verringern)","orig":"scenes/nobara_ruins_gojo_s_shirt/lines/39.mp3"},{"t":78.387,"end":81.015,"chars":[1],"who":"Yuji Itadori","text":"(Restrained laughter) (Lower your mic volume)","de":"(Verhaltenes Lachen) (Lautstärke Ihres Mikrofons verringern)","orig":"scenes/nobara_ruins_gojo_s_shirt/lines/40.mp3"},{"t":79.596,"end":81.016,"chars":[2],"who":"Megumi Fushiguro","text":"Nothing at all...! (Peeved)","de":"Gar nichts...! (Verärgert)","orig":"scenes/nobara_ruins_gojo_s_shirt/lines/41.mp3"},{"t":80.973,"end":82.542,"chars":[0],"who":"Nobara Kugisaki","text":"(Uncontainable giggling) (Lower your mic volume)","de":"(Unbändiges Kichern) (Mic-Lautstärke verringern)","orig":"scenes/nobara_ruins_gojo_s_shirt/lines/42.mp3"},{"t":81,"end":82.542,"chars":[1],"who":"Yuji Itadori","text":"(Uncontainable giggling) (Lower your mic volume)","de":"(Unbändiges Kichern) (Mic-Lautstärke verringern)","orig":"scenes/nobara_ruins_gojo_s_shirt/lines/43.mp3"},{"t":82.542,"end":88.816,"chars":[1],"who":"Yuji Itadori","text":"(Joyful laughter)","de":"(Freudiges Lachen)","orig":"scenes/nobara_ruins_gojo_s_shirt/lines/44.mp3"},{"t":82.542,"end":88.816,"chars":[0],"who":"Nobara Kugisaki","text":"(Joyful laughter)","de":"(Freudiges Lachen)","orig":"scenes/nobara_ruins_gojo_s_shirt/lines/45.mp3"},{"t":85.207,"end":86.852,"chars":[3],"who":"Satoru Gojo","text":"Huhh? (Shocked)","de":"Huhh? (Schockiert)","orig":"scenes/nobara_ruins_gojo_s_shirt/lines/46.mp3"},{"t":86.349,"end":88.141,"chars":[2],"who":"Megumi Fushiguro","text":"(Annoyed grunting)","de":"(Genervtes Grunzen)","orig":"scenes/nobara_ruins_gojo_s_shirt/lines/47.mp3"},{"t":88.795,"end":92.144,"chars":[1],"who":"Yuji Itadori","text":"(Trailing laughter)","de":"(Leidendes Gelächter)","orig":"scenes/nobara_ruins_gojo_s_shirt/lines/48.mp3","effect":"hall"},{"t":88.795,"end":92.144,"chars":[0],"who":"Nobara Kugisaki","text":"(Trailing laughter)","de":"(Leidendes Gelächter)","orig":"scenes/nobara_ruins_gojo_s_shirt/lines/49.mp3","effect":"hall"}]}